===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*bʰrewh₁-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|bernen}}, {{m|enm|birnen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|birnan||to burn}}, [[metathesis]] from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*brinnan}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*brinnaną||to burn}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*bʰrenw-}}, present stem from {{m|ine-pro|*bʰrewh₁-}}. {{doublet|en|brew}}.

See also {{cog|mga|brennim||drink up}}, {{m|mga|bruinnim||bubble up}}; also {{cog|mga|bréo||flame}}, {{cog|sq|burth||{{taxlink|Cyclamen hederifolium|species}}, mouth burning}}, {{cog|sa|भुरति||moves quickly, twitches, fidgets}}. More at {{m|en|brew}}.

